config MTD_NAND_QEMU_3DNAND
	tristate "QEMU 3D NAND controller"
	depends on PCI
	depends on MTD_RAW_NAND
	help
	  Enables the first-stage PCI probe driver for the QEMU 3D NAND
	  controller model. The initial driver reads controller geometry and
	  RAID profile registers; full MTD/raw NAND registration is added in
	  the next phase.
